; CARRERA (M1 greybox, rough: the ui-designer refines). BG rows 0-14 scroll with SCX (track);
; the WINDOW (WY = 120) holds row 15 = HUD and rows 16-17 = commentary (vwf, 2 lines).
; Row 0 = inside rail (WALL x4 / GRAY x4: 64 px period, motion cue); rows 1-14 = turf, one 8 px
; row per runner (row = rank by lane then gate). Col 13 = the 400 m post (DOOR column, written
; through gbe_vq when it scrolls in). Horses: BOX + saddlecloth digit, player's horse in OBP1.
tilesets: greybox font_mini font_mini_lower font_mini_es
legend:
# WALL
= GRAY
, FLOOR
| DOOR
: COLON
_ DOT
